Package: konaro-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.3),
         plasma-desktop (>= 4:6.3),
         kde-style-breeze,
         kwin-style-breeze,
         breeze-cursor-theme,
         kf6-breeze-icon-theme,
         fonts-inter
Recommends: sddm, sddm-theme-breeze, plymouth
Description: Konaro OS desktop identity for KDE Plasma
 Default look and feel of Konaro OS on top of KDE Plasma 6:
  - global themes "Konaro Light" and "Konaro Dark" (neutral palette);
  - top bar (launcher, global menu, system tray, clock) and a floating,
    centered bottom dock;
  - welcome splash ("hello" in several languages, then "Welcome to Konaro");
  - wallpapers, color schemes, icons and SDDM/lock screen defaults.
 .
 Defaults are installed in /etc/xdg and apply to users that have not
 customized their own settings.
